	["Click-cast bindings are kept per class in the profile. A class that has none there yet gets the healer suggestions for its spells; another class's bindings stay as they are."] = "Klikkastbindinger gemmes pr. klasse i profilen. En klasse som endnu ikke har nogen, får healerforslagene til sine evner; andre klassers bindinger røres ikke.",
