	["Make EldoUI easier to read, to hear and to follow. Each switch works on its own; Undo puts back what you had before the last change."] = "Gør EldoUI lettere at læse, høre og følge. Hver kontakt virker for sig; Fortryd gendanner det du havde før den seneste ændring.",
