	["PM"] = "PM",
	["Po"] = "Po",
	["Point at a button and press a key, a mouse button or the wheel to bind it. Escape over a button clears its keys; Escape anywhere else saves and leaves. Discard leaves without your changes."] = "Hold musen over en knap, og tryk på en tast, en museknap eller hjulet for at tildele den. Esc over en knap rydder dens taster; Esc et andet sted gemmer og lukker. Kasser lukker uden dine ændringer.",
